				2, 30</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 1, 93,
			13</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">zēlŏtypa</span></b> ,
